    "_postman_id": "7b8f9e61-9c32-4d5e-a812-70b13d7890fa",
    "name": "MerchVision - PRAN-RFL Rack Recognition & Token Analytics API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman API Collection for the **PRAN-RFL Rack Recognition System** backend service.\n\n### Backend Host\n- **Target Host:** `http://172.17.4.199:8093`\n- **Health Check:** `http://172.17.4.199:8093/health`\n- **Swagger Docs:** `http://172.17.4.199:8093/docs`\n- **Web UI:** `http://172.17.4.199:8093/ui`\n\n### Core Features\n1. **Single-Call Direct Analysis:** Immediate AI analysis returning product counts, tokens, and cost in 1 request (`/analyze`, `/analyze/url`).\n2. **Asynchronous Processing:** 202 Accepted upload queue + polling (`/uploads`, `/uploads/url`, `/uploads/{upload_id}`).\n3. **Analytics & Aggregations:** Summary token usage, total costs, top detected SKUs (`/uploads/summary`).\n4. **History & Management:** Search, pagination, filtering, and deletion of scans.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
